<title>SPAIN: Mapfre Vida interim dividend 35 ptas gross.</title>
<headline>Mapfre Vida interim dividend 35 ptas gross.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mapfre Vida, a unit of Spain's largest insurance group Corporacion Mapfre, said it would pay an interim dividend of 35 pesetas gross, 26.26 pesetas net, a bulletin from the Madrid bourse said.</p>
<p>The payment date is October 15.</p>
<p>The company last year paid three interim dividends of 35 pesetas gross and an additional dividend of 53 pesetas.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
